      "correct_option": "A",
      "formalization": "validated -> light_on; not light_on; therefore not validated",
      "answer_proof": "在题设的封闭规则中，这是否定后件的逆否推理：若完成校验必亮，而未亮，则未完成校验。",
      "distractor_map": {
